### Search with documented MVP defaults
# @name searchIssuesDefault
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/search
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-search-default

{
  "username": "{{username}}"
}

### Search issues that fit within half a day
# @name searchIssuesByAvailableTime
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/search?page=1&perPage=20
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-search-filtered

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "languages": ["Go", "TypeScript"],
  "frameworks": ["Gin", "React"],
  "labels": ["good first issue", "help wanted"],
  "minimumStars": 10,
  "maximumDifficulty": 3,
  "maximumEffort": "half_day",
  "updatedWithinDays": 180,
  "includeDocumentation": false,
  "includeEnglish": true,
  "excludeArchived": true
}

### Request the second server-ranked page
# @name searchIssuesSecondPage
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/search?page=2&perPage=5
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-search-page-two

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "maximumEffort": "one_day"
}

### Repeat the canonical search to observe X-IssueScout-Cache
# @name searchIssuesCached
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/search?page=1&perPage=20
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-search-cache-repeat

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "languages": ["Go", "TypeScript"],
  "frameworks": ["Gin", "React"],
  "labels": ["good first issue", "help wanted"],
  "minimumStars": 10,
  "maximumDifficulty": 3,
  "maximumEffort": "half_day",
  "updatedWithinDays": 180,
  "includeDocumentation": false,
  "includeEnglish": true,
  "excludeArchived": true
}

### [negative] Reject an unsupported effort band before GitHub I/O
# @name searchIssuesInvalidEffort
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-search-invalid-effort

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "maximumEffort": "weekend"
}

### [negative] Reject a null request body
# @name searchIssuesNullBody
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/issues/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: httpyac-issue-search-null

null
